WEBVTT

NOTE Authored baseline guidance. Offline synthetic Flite SLT narration. Sentence timing measured from exact PCM frames and verified with FFprobe; not word/phoneme alignment.

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.370
Authored guidance, with offline synthetic narration.

2
00:00:03.620 --> 00:00:07.605
This direct-drive teaching turbine starts at eight
meters per second wind.

3
00:00:07.855 --> 00:00:12.915
Play shows blades, shaft, and generator rotor
turning together at one-quarter speed.

4
00:00:13.165 --> 00:00:15.495
The stator and tower stay still.

5
00:00:15.745 --> 00:00:20.150
Pause, select each declared part, and pull it or use
its slider.

6
00:00:20.400 --> 00:00:24.695
Put it back, cancel to restore the entry, or reset
phase zero.

7
00:00:24.945 --> 00:00:28.045
Keep a comparison, then increase wind or pitch.

8
00:00:28.295 --> 00:00:35.600
Power follows wind speed cubed; our chosen
extraction coefficient is zero point three five
times cosine squared pitch.

9
00:00:35.850 --> 00:00:38.850
Efficiency is fixed at ninety percent.

10
00:00:39.100 --> 00:00:42.945
This is not a force solver, and pulling never
disconnects it.

11
00:00:43.195 --> 00:00:46.735
Own-account questions remain held by profile policy.

